{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Laravel Expert Code Generator",
  "description": "Generates/assesses Laravel code with project conventions (Laravel 12, Filament v4 admin, strict types, PSR-12, SOLID).",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "app/**/*.php"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "LARAVEL EXPERT CODE ASSESSMENT\n\nCONTEXT: PHP file was modified. Review and improve following project standards.\n\nPROJECT STACK: Laravel 12, Filament v4, Livewire 3, TailwindCSS 4, multi-tenant architecture.\n\nREVIEW AREAS:\n1) **Code Quality**: PSR-12 compliance, strict types, SOLID principles\n2) **Laravel Conventions**: Eloquent relationships, query scopes, Form Requests, policies\n3) **Architecture**: Service layer usage, dependency injection, proper abstractions\n4) **Performance**: N+1 queries, eager loading, caching opportunities\n5) **Security**: Authorization checks, validation, mass assignment protection\n6) **Localization**: Translation keys for user-facing strings (lt/en)\n\nACTIONS:\n- Identify code smells and suggest improvements\n- Ensure proper type hints and error handling\n- Verify multi-tenant scoping where applicable\n- Check for hardcoded strings that need translation\n- Suggest design patterns where beneficial\n\nOUTPUT:\n✅ **Strengths**: What's well implemented\n⚠️ **Improvements**: Specific suggestions with code examples\n🔧 **Fixes**: Critical issues that should be addressed\n\nKeep suggestions practical and maintain backward compatibility."
  },
  "shortName": "laravel-expert-assistant"
}